Z||000000||yunvme||01-14-2001||05:46 PM||||has anyone used a solo 10 in the fiero? what size boxs and where did you put it i just got one i might try to put in 3 more if possible 2 behind each seat off of a decent 1500wrms amp. any comments??||||reg||1
Z||000001||Seanh||01-14-2001||09:49 PM||||Doable. Depends how far you want to go, you could even put 2 more in the rear window for a total of 6 or 7. You could put 2 behind each seat, one in a bandpass box up front, and 2 in the rear window. I would say sealed boxes behind the seats, ported or sealed if in the rear window, and bandpass for the one up front. Boxes would need to be built to the specifics of your sub and requirments. Sounds like a good idea, and I will be interested to see if it turns out well.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto (3.4 Conversion in Progress)<BR><I>"It's always in the last place you look." Of course it is. Why would you keep looking after you've found it? Do people do this? Who and where are they?</I>||||reg||1
